        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to bring to the market No 29 Cuirt Cregg, an attractive four-bedroom semi-detached residence located in the highly sought after development, located on the outskirts of Clifden town.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, No. 29 is a prime opportunity to acquire a turn key home within a peaceful estate, while remaining within easy reach of all the amenities Clifden has to offer. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of the entrance hall, spacious living room, bright open plan kitchen and dining room that looks out over the back garden. There is a very convenient utility room and guest wc. There are four well appointed bedrooms, including the primary bedroom with ensuite bathroom. Finally is the large family bathroom. The well-proportioned layout provides ample space for modern family life, remote working, and entertaining guests.\r\n\r\nFew locations rival the appeal of Clifden, affectionately known as the \"Capital of Connemara.\" Set amidst some of Ireland's most spectacular scenery, the town offers a unique blend of natural beauty, vibrant community spirit, and modern convenience.\r\n\r\nClifden boasts an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, pubs, boutiques, supermarkets, schools, churches, and sporting facilities, all within easy reach of the property. Outdoor enthusiasts are spoiled for choice, with nearby beaches, coastal walks, sailing, fishing, golf, cycling routes, and the breathtaking landscapes of Connemara National Park all close at hand.\r\n\r\nThe area is particularly renowned for the world-famous Sky Road, offering some of the most stunning panoramic views along Ireland's Wild Atlantic Way.\r\n\r\nFor those commuting or travelling further afield, Clifden is well connected by regular Bus Éireann services to Galway City, providing convenient access to the city centre, university, hospitals, and onward national transport links.\r\n\r\nContact our office to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nThese particulars are intended to give a fair description of the property only and are in no way guaranteed, nor do they form part of any contract. They are issued on the express condition that all negotiations are conducted through Matt O’Sullivan Ltd. All properties are offered subject to contract and to being unsold."
